{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems you haven't",
                "awakened yet."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "Awaken?"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That Lunarian was hiding",
                "something important from me."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I heard everything from Misumaru,",
                "who created the Incident Stone."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Apparently, if you leave the impurity",
                "from the Outside World unchecked, youkai will die."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From the looks of it, everything here is",
                "already in its terminal stages... Rest in peace~"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Terminal stages?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's in its terminal stages?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? A youkai, for real?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Uh, I'm a shellfish youkai.",
                "I live here."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... You seem to be doing fine.",
                "Maybe Misumaru's worries were unfounded."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To awaken is to know the truth."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... So it wasn't an unfounded fear.",
                "Youkai really do die of that."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You obsolete humans are pitiful."
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You live and die in ignorance,",
                "without ever learning the truth."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But you still have a chance."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, awaken!",
                "Through my <i$Truth Mirage>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Waaah... The thing is... I'm just a fossilized shellfish",
                "that had been dormant here, you see..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You know, that god told me this."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This pyramid doesn't just shield",
                "the Lunar Capital, it protects Gensokyo as well."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Its role is to gather the misinformation comin'",
                "from outside and keep it at bay."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Misinformation...?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, all that \"truth\" you talk about",
                "is clearly nothing but lies."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And she said those lies are fatal to youkai,",
                "whose spirit is more important than their body."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hiding something that important...",
                "You really can't trust the Lunarians."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All those truths are lies...?",
                "Then... what's going to happen to me?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well... Who knows, I guess...",
                "Rest in peace, rest in peace~"
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just recently revived,",
                "and I still have no sense of self."
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please, don't abandon me!"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. Well then,",
                "get out of here right now!"
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just make sure the Lunarians",
                "don't find you."
            ]
        }
    }
}